{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MUDBIRD is a short gardening game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>a few features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">explore lush islands off the coast of the Pacific Northwest!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">interact with a whole cast of mysterious and friendly NPCs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">grab your trusty harness and zipline from island to island!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">save up your hard-earned cash to grab new precious goods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">use a flashlight to light up the night sky or your binoculars to discover the birds of the islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">grow flowers, go spearfishing, and forage for food!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">explore a mysterious underground cave and sneak into the neighborhoods houses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">send a message in a bottle to other players on their own islands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">lively, 2d top-down, hand-drawn pixelart graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">sit back, relax, and watch the waves</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572720?t=1751383147","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3572720?t=1751383147","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/5a7be2f4d495918de93a0b058871c3e7823d73c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751383147","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3572720/5a7be2f4d495918de93a0b058871c3e7823d73c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751383147","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MUDBIRD is a short gardening game!</p><p cl